# Clean Code (slim)

Tactical depth is in **R3** (`cc-functions-and-tests.mdc`) and `shared/docs/playbook.md` Part II. Do not duplicate R3 here.

## Self-documenting code

- **Meaningful names** — Intention-revealing; one word per concept; searchable
- **Small, focused units** — Functions and classes do one thing (see R3)
- **Express intent** — Code readable without narrating comments

## Comment policy

- **Avoid** comments that restate what the code does
- **Use** comments for *why*, business rules, TODO/FIXME with ticket refs, workarounds with issue links

## DRY and fail fast

- Extract duplication; constants/enums over magic values
- Validate preconditions early; reduce nesting with early returns

## AI-generated noise

See `ai-slop-cleanup.mdc` for high-confidence removals vs intentional style.

## Review and smells

Cite G/F/N/T heuristic IDs in review — full tables in R3 and `shared/docs/playbook.md` Appendix G.
